{"id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-finite.md","title":"Finite","display":"df-finite — Finite","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-finite","aliases":["89-df-finite","finite","Finite"],"display":"df-finite — Finite","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-finite</span><span>finite</span><span>Finite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite — Finite"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> is the set of natural numbers (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元有限性谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\n\\left(\nf:n\\to X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists i\\in n\\;(f(i)=x)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(f(i)=f(j)\\to i=j)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\n\\left(\nf:n\\to X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists i\\in n\\;(f(i)=x)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(f(i)=f(j)\\to i=j)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\)</span> says that some natural number <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> is in bijection\nwith <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; totality and surjectivity are now explicit.</li>\n<li>This predicate is used for finite Kripke models and finite countermodels in GL.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$ is the set of natural numbers (see [[58-df-omega]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists f\\;\n\\left(\nf:n\\to X\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists i\\in n\\;(f(i)=x)\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(f(i)=f(j)\\to i=j)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":882,"backlinks":[{"id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ is the predicate from [[89-df-finite]]."},{"id":"5026751112f75f31","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLFrame}$ and $\\mathrm{Finite}$ are the predicates from\n[[89-df-gl-frame]] and [[89-df-finite]]."},{"id":"c61ecbdec24f26e8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ is the predicate from [[89-df-finite]]."},{"id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"74c9df4215ffa321","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[89-df-consistent-pa.md]]\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded.md]]\n[[89-df-dejongh-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-diamond-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-filtration.md]]\n[[89-df-finite.md]]\n[[89-df-finite-model-property.md]]\n[[89-df-fixed-point-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[89-df-generated-submodel.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-algorithm.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-4.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-k.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-l-def.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom-l.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-completeness-theorem.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-complexity.md]]\n[[89-df-gl-c